  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{容疑|ようぎ}→容疑：12317_yougi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{否認|ひにん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (deny allegations/charges)\n- ⟦{関与|かんよ}→関与：08646_kanyo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{否認|ひにん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (deny involvement)\n- ⟦{全面|ぜんめん}→全面：22735_zenmen⟧{否認|ひにん} (complete denial)\n- ⟦{事実|じじつ}→事実：03271_jijitsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{否認|ひにん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (deny the facts)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n⟦{否定|ひてい}→否定：03707_hitei⟧ (denial, negation) is a broader term — you can deny facts, ideas, or existence. {否認|ひにん} is more specific and formal, typically used for denying accusations, charges, or responsibility. In legal contexts, {否認|ひにん} is the standard term for a defendant's denial of charges.",
